    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970422.0086\n\nBEIJING, April 22 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nURGENTChinese foreign minister to visit US next week\n\n\n\n\nChinese Foreign Minister Qian Qichen will visit the United States next week to meet with President Bill Clinton and top-level US officials, foreign ministry spokesman Cui Tiankai said Tuesday.",
